# Agent OS — Authors

The original author and maintainer of Agent OS is:

  Shifat Islam Santo  <shifatislamsanto764@gmail.com>  (GitHub: oneKn8)

Agent OS was conceived and designed by Shifat Islam Santo in 2026 as a
local-first, vendor-neutral broker for AI agents. The vision, architecture,
adapter-layer thesis, and product framing are his original work, captured in
the project's git history beginning with commit 7efe110 on 2026-05-05.

Sibling project `machine-memory` (the substrate Agent OS depends on) is also
authored and maintained by Shifat Islam Santo:
  https://github.com/oneKn8/machine-memory

Future contributors are listed below. Thanks to everyone who helps build
the broker that no vendor will ship.

